# Trivy config-scan suppressions (Phase 15/16). Each entry is a deliberate,
# documented acceptance — not a blanket mute.

# AWS-0104 — "unrestricted egress" on the EKS worker node security group.
# This lives inside the upstream terraform-aws-modules/eks module: worker nodes
# must reach the internet/AWS APIs to pull images, join the cluster, and talk to
# EKS/ECR/STS. Restricting it fully breaks a managed node group. Accepted as
# inherent to EKS; ingress remains locked down and the API endpoint is private
# by default (see infra/terraform/environments/aws).
AWS-0104
